  "details": "VRChat is working on a new tool for the Unity Editor. It will allow creators to import various examples related to the VRChat SDK.\n\nInitially, the examples will focus on VRChat's upcoming Persistence and Creator Economy features. Eventually, we'd like to include more examples for creators of all skill levels.\n\nThe example importer does not require the Creator Companion or VPM packages. Examples are imported as `.unitypackage` files. All examples will be listed on https://ask.vrchat.com/, allowing users to discover, discuss, or upvote examples.",
